    "summaries": [
      {
        "action_date": "2025-12-12",
        "action_desc": "Reported to House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Main Street Parity Act</strong></p><p>This bill lessens the financing requirements for certain Small Business&nbsp;Administration loans to small businesses for plant acquisition, construction, conversion, or expansion, including the acquisition of land.&nbsp;Specifically, the bill reduces the amount of equity a borrower must provide&nbsp;by 5% of the total cost for loans for limited or single-purpose properties.</p>",
        "update_date": "2026-01-16T20:35:48Z"
      }
    ]
  },
